    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125511
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "吉塔",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]沒想到",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125511
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "吉塔",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]他竟然擁有那種程度的戰鬥力……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125511
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]他",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118402_001",
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]原本擁有的知識與才能……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]結合了過去鍊金術師遺留在那裡的研究成果，",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "\\n[FFFFFFFF]才讓他得到了如此強大的力量呢。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]……那間宅邸",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118402_002",
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "碧卡拉",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]對他而言一定就是烏～托邦呢。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "花凜",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]無論如何，",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118402_003",
    "unit_id": 125711
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "花凜",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]能在目前的時間點阻止他真是太好了。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125711
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "花凜",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125711
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "花凜",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]如果是在他戰力增加後的狀態下跟他對峙，",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125711
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "花凜",
    "words": "\\n[FFFFFFFF]我們也不曉得會變得怎樣。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125711
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "吉塔",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]確實，",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118402_004",
    "unit_id": 125511
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "吉塔",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]雖然我覺得會陷入苦戰……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125511
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "吉塔",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125511
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "吉塔",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]但一定會有辦法的喔。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125511
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "吉塔",
    "words": "\\n[FFFFFFFF]因為……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125511
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "吉塔",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]我們並不是孤身一人嘛。",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5118402_005",
    "unit_id": 125511
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "吉塔",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125511
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "吉塔",
    "words": "[FFFFFFFF]我們擁有一起戰鬥的夥伴啊！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 125511
  }
]
